# media/ is generated by tools/sync-media.py and is not committed:
# - posters, videos, loops and thumbnails are copies of marketing/posters/out and marketing/video/out
#   (about 25 MB that the repository already holds once);
# - media/demo-loop.bin is licensed music ("Fun Vibe" by Dyalla, YouTube Audio Library), written by
#   sync-media.py as the MP3 behind a reversible byte scramble so the site never serves a playable
#   music file (not copy protection: demo.js reverses it in memory). The licence does not allow the
#   music to be distributed on its own, so it is deployed with the site and never committed. Without
#   it the demo plays its synthesised fallback.
# Run `python tools/sync-media.py` before previewing or deploying.
media/

# wrangler's local state
.wrangler/
